@startuml Digi Bank - Version and Database Strategy

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title Digi Bank\nVersion and Database Strategy

artifact "Java 21\nLTS runtime" as java
artifact "Spring Boot 4.1.0\nmanaged dependencies" as boot
artifact "Maven project\nversion 1.0.0" as maven
artifact "digibank-app.war\nversioned deployable" as war

database "PostgreSQL 16" as postgres
artifact "Flyway V1\nbaseline schema" as v1
artifact "Flyway V2\nseed data" as v2
artifact "Hibernate\nddl-auto: validate" as validate

java --> boot: runtime baseline
boot --> maven: dependency management
maven --> war: packages
war --> postgres: connects
v1 --> postgres: applies first
v2 --> postgres: applies next
validate --> postgres: verifies mapping

note right of war
  Application release and database evolution
  are explicit, ordered, and reviewable.
end note

note bottom of postgres
  Flyway changes the schema.
  Hibernate validates the resulting schema.
end note

@enduml
